graph TD
    classDef danger fill:#FEF2F2,stroke:#EF4444,stroke-width:2px,color:#991B1B;
    classDef success fill:#F0FDF4,stroke:#22C55E,stroke-width:2px,color:#166534;
    classDef neutral fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#E5E7EB,stroke-width:2px,color:#111827;
    classDef governance fill:#F0F9FF,stroke:#0EA5E9,stroke-width:2px,color:#0369A1;

    A[Agent Generates Code] ::: neutral --> B{Verification Router} ::: governance
    
    B -->|Tests Fail| C[Autonomous QA Loop] ::: governance
    C --> D{Max Loops Reached?} ::: neutral
    D -->|Yes| E[Halt: Context Rot Detected] ::: danger
    D -->|No| A
    
    B -->|Tests Pass| F[Hallucination Scorer] ::: governance
    F -->|Variance > Threshold| C
    F -->|Variance < Threshold| G[Escalate to Human] ::: success
    
    G --> H{Reviewer Escalation} ::: governance
    H -->|Architectural| I[Principal Engineer Sign-off] ::: success
    H -->|UI Only| J[Standard Peer Review] ::: neutral
